  terrain: Sheer cliffs, winding passes, avalanche-scarred slopes, fortified ridgelines, collapsed tunnels, old military outposts, and steep switchback roads.
  vegetation: Sparse shrubs, pine, and alpine grass.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: AA guns, radar dishes, bunkers, outposts. Rural: cabins, fences, wooden structures. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, drones.'
  effects: Mountain fog, dust, wind, and rockfall.
  audio: Wind, machinery, rock impacts, and radio chatter.
  lodBudget:
  - category: Primary Terrain
    count: 3
    trianglesPerItem: 200000
    totalTriangles: 600000
  - category: Industrial/Rural
    count: 4
    trianglesPerItem: 80000
    totalTriangles: 320000
